	<true/>
	<key>NSAppTransportSecurity</key>
	<dict/>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>NextIgnition uses the camera so you can capture and upload profile photos and attach pitch media for your startup campaigns. For example, you can snap a new profile photo or take a photo of your pitch materials directly in the app.</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>NextIgnition uses the microphone to enable voice recording, participation in interactive audio rooms, and live video calls. For example, you can speak in live mentorship sessions or record voice introductions for your profile.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>NextIgnition needs access to your photo library so you can select and upload profile photos, pitch decks, and documents. For example, you can select a PDF of your pitch deck or a saved image of your logo to upload to your profile.</string>
	<key>UILaunchStoryboardName</key>
	<string>LaunchScreen</string>
	<key>UIMainStoryboardFile</key>
	<string>Main</string>
